// Clean up when done
engine.stopSync();
```

## Conflict Resolution
- Last-writer-wins for scalar values; CRDT counters/g-sets for concurrent edits
- Auto-merge without user intervention; conflicts exposed only when semantically impossible to resolve

## Memory Footprint
- Tombstone GC prunes deleted entries above threshold
- Inbox cap (e.g., 1000 pending ops) with spilling to disk
- Lazy loading of historical states

## Battery Impact
- Background thread with coarse-grained intervals (every 5-15s)
- Exponential backoff on failures; WiFi-only mode option
- Backpressure: pause sync when screen off or low battery

